/T (The Wendy Francis Foundation is a non-profit foundation committed to building and empowering communities, with a special focus on women and youth. Our mission is to create a world where every individual has the opportunity to reach their full potential, regardless of their background or circumstances. We believe that by providing learning, self-development opportunities, and humanitarian aid, we can uplift communities and help them thrive.)
