238 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 92 0 R
/T (Our Ganesh Murti-Making Workshop allows for the exploration of your creative and spiritual side! We offer free classes on crafting beautiful Ganesh idols. It's a perfect opportunity for families to bond, spend quality time, and celebrate our rich cultural heritage together especially during the auspicious observance of Ganesh Utsav. Let's create art, memories, and cultural connections!)
