/Title (Over the years, The Wendy Francis Foundation has touched countless lives. We measure our success not just in numbers but in the smiles we bring, the dreams we inspire, and the communities we help uplift. We've provided hundreads of meals, educational opportunities, and support to those in need, all while empowering women and youth to lead the way towards a brighter future.)
