/Title (With weekly planning, every Saturday, we come together to prepare, cook, and distribute meals to the poor, vulnerable, and homeless persons  in our local communities and by extension to all from far in need. We extend our reach to various areas in Trinidad, recognizing that hunger knows no boundaries.)
